obj_id: agentGenerated_SeasonalSalesPatternsRADSuperstore-2d3907e9
liveboard:
  name: agentGenerated_Seasonal Sales Patterns RAD Superstore
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 156fd0f1-2411-48dc-b158-a585b4b2bd39
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • End-of-year surge drives peak performance with November (352K) and December (325K) sales, representing 38% of annual revenue in Q4
        • Winter slump creates major vulnerability with February generating only 59K in sales - lowest month
        • Weekend purchasing behavior dominates with Sunday leading at 411K vs Friday's 186K
        • Year-over-year growth trend shows consistent seasonal pattern amplification

        Recommendations:
        • Maximize Q4 momentum through targeted holiday campaigns and inventory planning for Nov-Dec peak
        • Combat winter slump with February promotions and new product launches to boost Q1 performance
        • Shift marketing spend to weekends, especially Sunday campaigns, while reducing Friday advertising investment
  - id: Viz_2
    answer:
